A simple study project aiming to implement Hexagonal Architecture in the simplest way possible, separating the layers logically but with the minimum amount of boilerplate code possible. 
The project consists of an API for querying Bitcoin blockchain data.

Folder structure

/adapter = Contains all input and output adapters (Controllers, Repositories, and FeignClient) 

/application = I chose to separate domain utilities from domain logic, therefore it contains useCase and domain 

/port = Input and output ports of the adapters 

Technologies

Java 17 
Spring Boot 
Spring Web 
Spring Cloud OpenFeign (Integration with third-party APIs) 
Lombok (Productivity, use of annotations to replace repetitive code)